Sample ID: integer between 1 and 99999
DNA Concentration: float between 0.0 and 1000.0
PCR Primer Set: Primer Set A, Primer Set B, Primer Set C
Gel Type: Agarose, Polyacrylamide
Sequencing Run ID: integer between 1 and 9999
Quality Score: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Vector Type: Plasmid A, Plasmid B, Plasmid C
Colony Count: integer between 0 and 1000
Protein Concentration: float between 0.0 and 1000.0
Antibody Type: Antibody Type A, Antibody Type B, Antibody Type C
